{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约书亚记","commonName":"约书亚记","title":"约书亚记","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"9eb685769afd97937413dc8bd46c6ab5d21b53bc9e539bc2e909ca5de41a1ee6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":654},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["约瑟子孙分到的土地"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["约瑟的子孙抽签所得的地方是从耶利哥附近的约旦河，就是耶利哥水泉的东面开始，穿过旷野，直到伯特利山区；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["又从伯特利，即路斯，延至亚基人的疆土亚他绿，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["然后西下至押利提人的疆土，远至下伯·和仑地区，经基色直到地中海。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["约瑟的儿子玛拿西和以法莲得了自己的产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以下是以法莲的子孙按宗族分到的土地：东面从亚他录·亚达到上伯·和仑，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["直到地中海；北面从密米他向东绕到他纳·示罗，到雅挪哈东部，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["再到亚他录、拿拉，经耶利哥直到约旦河；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又从他普亚往西到加拿河，直到地中海。这就是以法莲的子孙按宗族所分的产业。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["此外，他们又从玛拿西人的产业中，分到部分城邑及其附近的乡村。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们没有赶走住在基色的迦南人，迦南人至今还住在以法莲人当中，为他们服劳役。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api